ART. 170. Exemptions. — The following employees are exempt
from the coverage of this Title:

Any person whose employment is purely casual and is not for the
purposes of the occupation or business of the employer;
Any person employed as a domestic helper;
Any immediate member of the family of the employer who
lives with him; and
Any elective public official.

