Department of Trade and Industry;

Department of Education, Culture and Sports;

Department of Health;

Department of Agriculture;

four (4) representatives from consumer organizations of nationwide base to be chosen by the President from among the nominees submitted by the various consumer groups in the Philippines;

two (2) representatives from business/industry sector to be chosen by the President from among the nominees submitted by the various business organizations.

